  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Monroeville, PA\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Monroeville, PA\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nMonroeville, PA\nSpecialty\n412.810.6732\n4224 Northern Pike\nMonroeville, PA 15146\n[email protected]\nUrgent care:\nSun-Fri: 10 am-10 pm\nSurgery:\nMon: 8 am-5 pm\nTue-Thu: 7 am-5 pm\nFri: 7 am-4 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOpen now! We’re thrilled to offer urgent care services for pets Sunday-Friday 10 am-10 pm.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital - serving greater Pittsburgh.\nWe are conveniently located about 13 miles east of downtown Pittsburgh off Northern Pike, close to the junction of 376 and 76. We provide surgical care for pets east of the Pittsburgh area, including Penn Hills, Plum, Murrysville, West Mifflin and beyond.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nOur experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nSpecialty care\nFrom initial diagnosis to ongoing care, we communicate closely with you and your family veterinarian on a comprehensive treatment plan designed to improve your pet's quality of life.\nOur specialty teams utilize their extensive knowledge and sophisticated diagnostic technology to pinpoint your pet’s precise condition and deliver the care they need to get back to doing what they love most.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Monroeville.\nOur goal is to help pets in need of surgery in a comfortable, compassionate and friendly environment. We practice to the highest ethical standards and treat our patients like our own with unsurpassed care.\nOur 12,000-square-foot pet hospital offers advanced treatment and diagnostic services, a comprehensive in-house laboratory with commercial grade equipment, and a pharmacy for quick access to the medications your pet needs to feel better, faster.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl, providing our customers with exceptional service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n412.810.6732\n412.810.6734\n4224 Northern Pike\nMonroeville,\nPA                                    15146\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Pittsburgh North\nPittsburgh, PA\n807 Camp Horne Rd.\nPittsburgh, PA 15237\n412.366.3400\n17.82 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Pittsburgh South\nWashington, PA\n1535 Washington Rd.\nWashington, PA 15301\n724.809.2000\n27.26 miles\nSkylos Sports Medicine\nFredrick, MD\n434 Prospect Blvd\nFrederick, MD 21701\n410.465.2428\n142.29 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
